quickfast-ng provides CMake targets:

    find_package(QuickFAST CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE QuickFAST::QuickFAST)

Every QuickFAST header requires <Application/QuickFAST.h> to be included first,
preferably from a precompiled header:

    #include <Application/QuickFAST.h>
    #include <Codecs/Decoder.h>
